# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# 1. 保持泛型签名、注解和内部类结构（防止 TypeToken 反序列化为 LinkedTreeMap）
-keepattributes Signature, InnerClasses, EnclosingMethod, RuntimeVisibleAnnotations

# 2. Gson 核心反射类与 TypeToken 保留
-keep class com.google.gson.reflect.TypeToken { *; }
-keep class * extends com.google.gson.reflect.TypeToken
-keep class com.google.gson.** { *; }

# 3. 业务数据模型类及成员完全保留（供 Gson 与 SQLite DAO 安全访问）
-keep class com.parent.tvlock.db.model.** { *; }
-keepclassmembers class com.parent.tvlock.db.model.** { *; }
